# Shadowrocket domain RULE-SET | 2026-10-09
# Source: https://github.com/blackmatrix7/ios_rule_script/tree/master/rule/Shadowrocket
# Coverage: AI, cloud, payments, social, streaming, IM, travel,
# shopping, banking, productivity and development services.
# Curated common services and verified login/API/CDN dependencies; no bulk imports.
# DOMAIN-SUFFIX matches the domain and its subdomains.
# Shared cloud/CDN suffixes also match other tenants; review before routing all traffic.
# IP-CIDR, IP-ASN, DOMAIN-KEYWORD, USER-AGENT and URL-REGEX are excluded.

